Cached page snapshots

data/raw/state_*.html and data/raw/sitemap-listings-0.xml are verbatim snapshots
of public, server-rendered pages from shopgarage.com, fetched read-only on
2026-08-14 under the guardrails documented in fetch.sh. That content is Garage's,
not mine, and the MIT grant above does not extend to it. It is committed so the
back-test reproduces offline against the exact bytes it was built from.

data/dataset.csv is derived from those snapshots: every field is read out of each
page's own __NEXT_DATA__ payload. Prices are ASKING prices on ACTIVE listings, not
closed sale prices.

If you are Garage and would prefer the snapshots not be redistributed, open an
issue and I will remove them; build_dataset.py and the model do not depend on any
particular listing.
